{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Askoda 统一前端 BFF","description":"业务用户唯一入口。仅通过 MCP 网关触达后端能力，不直连任何开源组件、不直连业务库。所有接口前缀 /api/v1（契约版本化）。","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/v1/health":{"get":{"tags":["运维"],"summary":"Health","operationId":"health_api_v1_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"title":"Response Health Api V1 Health Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tools":{"get":{"tags":["运维"],"summary":"Tools","operationId":"tools_api_v1_tools_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"title":"Response Tools Api V1 Tools Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/datasets":{"get":{"tags":["元数据"],"summary":"Datasets","operationId":"datasets_api_v1_datasets_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"title":"Response Datasets Api V1 Datasets Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/demand":{"post":{"tags":["需求"],"summary":"Create Demand","operationId":"create_demand_api_v1_demand_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DemandCreateIn"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"title":"Response Create Demand Api V1 Demand Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/demand/similar-precheck":{"post":{"tags":["需求"],"summary":"Similar Precheck","description":"相似需求预检。\n\n实盘核对结论：本机网关实例**未暴露** `demand_similar_precheck` 工具\n（源码 gateway/app.py 有定义，但容器跑的是旧镜像；tools/list 只有 41 个）。\n因此这里优先调原生工具，不可用时降级为「demand_list 拉候选 + difflib\n字符级相似度」，语义与 gateway/demand.py:163 find_similar 保持一致。","operationId":"similar_precheck_api_v1_demand_similar_precheck_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SimilarPrecheckIn"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Resp